 MST MORPH APPLY SKIP ... reason=already-authoritative
 ```
 
+`MST APPEARANCE DETAIL` is off by default. The probe emits one line per node,
+tint and overlay, up to 45 of them for a single appearance change, so set
+`Verbose=1` under `[AppearanceProbe]` in
+`Data/SKSE/Plugins/MorphSyncTogether.ini` only while diagnosing a value that
+refuses to sync.
+
 ## Build
 
 Run:
diff --git a/package/Data/SKSE/Plugins/MorphSyncTogether.ini b/package/Data/SKSE/Plugins/MorphSyncTogether.ini
index 9ea8059..0b95811 100644
